<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SynergyMind: AI-Powered Organizational Growth</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #F0F3F5;
        }
        .chart-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            height: 320px;
            max-height: 400px;
        }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .chart-container {
                height: 350px;
            }
        }
        .flow-line {
            position: relative;
        }
        .flow-line::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            top: 100%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 2rem;
            background-color: #00A896;
        }
        .pillar-line::after {
             content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            bottom: 100%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 2rem;
            background-color: #00A896;
        }
        .pillar-container {
            position: relative;
        }
        .horizontal-line {
            width: calc(100% - 4rem);
            height: 2px;
            background-color: #00A896;
            position: absolute;
            top: -2rem;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-gray-800">

    <main class="container mx-auto p-4 md:p-8">

        <header class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-[#0A2F5B] mb-2">SynergyMind</h1>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#005A8D] font-semibold">Revolutionizing Workforce Potential with Agentic AI</p>
        </header>

        <section class="mb-12 md:mb-16 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-xl p-6 md:p-8 border-t-4 border-[#00A896]">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0A2F5B] text-center mb-4">The Opportunity: Unlocking Human Capital</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto text-gray-600">
                Traditional corporate training is broken. It's costly, inefficient, and fails to engage employees. The result? A massive loss in potential, productivity, and innovation. SynergyMind addresses this multi-billion dollar problem by transforming learning and development from a cost center into a strategic growth driver, creating agile, competitive, and future-proof organizations.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0A2F5B] text-center mb-8">The SynergyMind Ecosystem: A 16-Agent Neural Network</h2>
            <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
                 <div class="bg-[#0A2F5B] text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg inline-block flow-line">
                    SynergyMind Core AI
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:block w-full mt-8">
                     <div class="relative flex justify-center">
                        <div class="horizontal-line"></div>
                     </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-8 md:mt-16">
                    <div class="pillar-container">
                         <div class="pillar-line"></div>
                        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md h-full">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#005A8D] mb-3">Talent Development</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600">Delivers hyper-personalized learning paths and intelligently identifies and closes skill gaps in real-time.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pillar-container">
                        <div class="pillar-line"></div>
                        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md h-full">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0081A7] mb-3">Knowledge Management</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600">Automates content curation, provides intelligent search, and facilitates expert identification to unlock collective intelligence.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pillar-container">
                         <div class="pillar-line"></div>
                        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md h-full">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#00A896] mb-3">Operational Efficiency</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600">Streamlines L&D administration, forecasts future skill needs, and automates compliance and reporting.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                 <p class="mt-8 text-gray-600">Our 16 goal-oriented, model-based learning agents work in concert across these three pillars to drive unprecedented growth and efficiency.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12 md:mb-16">
            <div class="lg:col-span-1 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center">
                 <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A2F5B] mb-2">Reduced Training Costs</h3>
                 <p class="text-6xl font-black text-[#00A896]">45%</p>
                 <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Projected reduction in annual training expenditure through automation and personalization.</p>
            </div>
             <div class="lg:col-span-1 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center">
                 <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A2F5B] mb-2">Increased Engagement</h3>
                 <p class="text-6xl font-black text-[#0081A7]">35%</p>
                 <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Projected increase in employee engagement scores and course completion rates.</p>
            </div>
             <div class="lg:col-span-1 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center">
                 <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A2F5B] mb-2">Faster Upskilling</h3>
                 <p class="text-6xl font-black text-[#005A8D]">50%</p>
                 <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Projected acceleration in time-to-competency for critical skills and new roles.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12 md:mb-16">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A2F5B] text-center mb-4">Projected Return on Investment (ROI)</h3>
                 <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-4">SynergyMind is not just a tool, it's an investment in your greatest asset. We project a rapid and compounding return by boosting productivity and reducing operational overhead.</p>
                <div class="chart-container">
                    <canvas id="roiChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A2F5B] text-center mb-4">Market Growth: L&D Tech</h3>
                <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-4">The global market for AI in Education and Corporate Training is expanding rapidly, creating a prime opportunity for a market-leading solution like SynergyMind.</p>
                <div class="chart-container">
                    <canvas id="marketChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 mb-12 md:mb-16">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A2F5B] text-center mb-4">Competitive Advantage</h3>
            <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">While traditional LMS platforms offer static content, SynergyMind provides a dynamic, intelligent, and holistic ecosystem. Our multi-agent approach creates a significant competitive moat.</p>
            <div class="chart-container max-w-md">
                 <canvas id="comparisonChart"></canvas>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <footer class="text-center bg-[#0A2F5B] text-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-xl">
             <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Invest in the Future of Work</h2>
             <p class="text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6">SynergyMind is uniquely positioned to capture the market and deliver exceptional returns. We are seeking $2M in seed funding to scale our engineering team, accelerate customer acquisition, and solidify our position as the industry leader in AI-driven talent optimization.</p>
             <button class="bg-[#00A896] hover:bg-[#0081A7] text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition-colors duration-300">Contact Us to Learn More</button>
        </footer>

    </main>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const wrapLabel = (label) => {
                const maxLength = 16;
                if (typeof label !== 'string' || label.length <= maxLength) {
                    return label;
                }
                const words = label.split(' ');
                const lines = [];
                let currentLine = '';
                for (const word of words) {
                    if ((currentLine + ' ' + word).length > maxLength) {
                        lines.push(currentLine);
                        currentLine = word;
                    } else {
                        currentLine = currentLine ? currentLine + ' ' + word : word;
                    }
                }
                lines.push(currentLine);
                return lines;
            };

            const tooltipTitleCallback = (tooltipItems) => {
                const item = tooltipItems[0];
                let label = item.chart.data.labels[item.dataIndex];
                if (Array.isArray(label)) {
                    return label.join(' ');
                }
                return label;
            };
            
            const commonTooltipOptions = {
                plugins: {
                    tooltip: {
                        callbacks: {
                            title: tooltipTitleCallback
                        },
                        backgroundColor: '#0A2F5B',
                        titleFont: { size: 14, weight: 'bold' },
                        bodyFont: { size: 12 },
                        padding: 10,
                        cornerRadius: 4,
                        displayColors: false,
                    }
                }
            };

            const roiChartCtx = document.getElementById('roiChart').getContext('2d');
            new Chart(roiChartCtx, {
                type: 'line',
                data: {
                    labels: ['Year 1', 'Year 2', 'Year 3', 'Year 4', 'Year 5'],
                    datasets: [{
                        label: 'Projected ROI (%)',
                        data: [40, 95, 180, 275, 410],
                        borderColor: '#00A896',
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(0, 168, 150, 0.1)',
                        fill: true,
                        tension: 0.4
                    }]
                },
                options: {
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                    scales: {
                        y: {
                            beginAtZero: true,
                            ticks: {
                                callback: function(value) { return value + '%' }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                     ...commonTooltipOptions
                }
            });

            const marketChartCtx = document.getElementById('marketChart').getContext('2d');
            new Chart(marketChartCtx, {
                type: 'bar',
                data: {
                    labels: ['2023', '2024', '2025', '2026 (Proj.)'],
                    datasets: [{
                        label: 'Global L&D Tech Market ($B)',
                        data: [350, 375, 410, 450],
                        backgroundColor: ['#005A8D', '#0081A7', '#00A896', '#0A2F5B'],
                        borderRadius: 4
                    }]
                },
                options: {
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                     scales: {
                        y: {
                            ticks: {
                                callback: function(value) { return '$' + value + 'B' }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    ...commonTooltipOptions,
                    plugins: { ...commonTooltipOptions.plugins, legend: { display: false } }
                }
            });

            const comparisonChartCtx = document.getElementById('comparisonChart').getContext('2d');
            new Chart(comparisonChartCtx, {
                type: 'radar',
                data: {
                    labels: [
                        'Personalization',
                        wrapLabel('Skill Gap Analysis'),
                        'Efficiency',
                        'Scalability',
                        wrapLabel('Predictive Insights'),
                        'Cost-Effectiveness'
                    ],
                    datasets: [{
                        label: 'SynergyMind',
                        data: [9, 9.5, 8.5, 9, 9, 8],
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(0, 168, 150, 0.2)',
                        borderColor: '#00A896',
                        pointBackgroundColor: '#00A896'
                    }, {
                        label: 'Traditional L&D',
                        data: [3, 2, 4, 5, 1, 4],
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(10, 47, 91, 0.2)',
                        borderColor: '#0A2F5B',
                        pointBackgroundColor: '#0A2F5B'
                    }]
                },
                options: {
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                    ...commonTooltipOptions,
                     plugins: {
                        ...commonTooltipOptions.plugins,
                        legend: {
                            position: 'top',
                        }
                     },
                     scales: {
                        r: {
                            angleLines: {
                                color: '#e2e8f0'
                            },
                            grid: {
                                color: '#e2e8f0'
                            },
                            pointLabels: {
                                font: {
                                    size: 12,
                                    weight: 'bold'
                                },
                                color: '#005A8D'
                            },
                            ticks: {
                                beginAtZero: true,
                                max: 10,
                                stepSize: 2,
                                backdropColor: 'transparent',
                                color: '#64748b'
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
